  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MA-Equitable and sustainable WASH services in Bong County</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to ensure equitable access to safe water and sanitation facilities; improve hygiene and sanitation practices in schools and communities to enable them to develop life-long positive hygiene and sanitation behaviors; and support the MoE in their program implementation and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
